    body: [
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Student", text: "Good morning, sir. May I come in?" },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Manager", text: "Good morning. Yes, please come in and sit down. What can I do for you?" },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Student", text: "Thank you, sir. I want to open an account in your bank." },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Manager", text: "Very good. What kind of account do you want to open?" },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Student", text: "I am a student of class ten. I want to save a little money every month, so I think a savings account will suit me." },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Manager", text: "You are right. A savings account is best for students. We have a special student account too, which you can open with only one hundred taka." },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Student", text: "That is good news. What are the formalities?" },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Manager", text: "You will have to fill in an account opening form. As you are under eighteen, your father or mother will have to operate the account jointly with you as your guardian." },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Student", text: "My father has come with me. He is waiting outside. What documents do we need?" },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Manager", text: "Two copies of your passport-size photograph, a copy of your birth registration certificate and your school ID card. Your father will need his National ID card and two photographs." },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Student", text: "I have brought them all. Do I need an introducer?" },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Manager", text: "Yes, an existing account holder of this bank has to introduce you. Does your father have an account here?" },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Student", text: "Yes, sir. He has been a client of this branch for ten years." },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Manager", text: "Then he can introduce you. That makes it easy." },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Student", text: "Will I get any interest on my money?" },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Manager", text: "Yes, the bank will give you interest on your balance every six months." },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Student", text: "Can I withdraw money whenever I need it?" },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Manager", text: "Certainly. You will get a cheque book and a debit card. You can also use our mobile app to see your balance and deposit money." },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Student", text: "Is there any charge for the account?" },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Manager", text: "For student accounts there is no yearly charge, and you don't have to keep a large minimum balance." },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Student", text: "That is wonderful. Please give me the form." },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Manager", text: "Here it is. Fill it in carefully, sign in these places, and ask your father to sign as your guardian and introducer. Then submit it with the documents and your first deposit at counter number three." },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Student", text: "When will the account be opened?" },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Manager", text: "Today, in fact. You will get your account number within an hour, and the cheque book in a week." },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Student", text: "Thank you very much for your kind help, sir." },
      { type: "dialogue", speaker: "Manager", text: "You are most welcome. I am glad to see a young person learning to save." },
    ],
